# Hardware safety

The ESP32-C3 gateway is real industrial hardware.

## Forbidden without explicit authorization

- Flash / erase / overwrite firmware
- Access COM8 or any serial port
- Modify connected hardware or run electrical tests
- Change GPIO assignments or terminal-block mappings
- Modify power circuitry, remove protection/isolation, or alter enclosure/PCB manufacturing outputs

## When physical testing is authorized, report

Device identity · HW revision · FW revision · setup · tools · observations · result · limitations

Compilation and simulation are **not** physical hardware verification.
